{"speciesId":809,"names":{"fr":"Melmetal","es":"Melmetal","en":"Melmetal","ja":"メルメタル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Autrefois vénéré pour son aptitude à produire du fer, ce Pokémon a mystérieusement ressuscité après 3 000 ans."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"En la antigüedad se le veneraba por su poder de crear hierro. Después de tres milenios, ha regresado misteriosamente."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Revered long ago for its capacity to create iron from nothing, for some reason it has come back to life after 3,000 years."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"鉄を 産み出す 力を 持つと 崇められていた。 ３０００年の 時を 経て なぜか 蘇った。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Autrefois vénéré pour son aptitude à produire du fer, ce Pokémon a mystérieusement ressuscité après 3 000 ans."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"En la antigüedad se le veneraba por su poder de crear hierro. Después de tres milenios, ha regresado misteriosamente."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Revered long ago for its capacity to create iron from nothing, for some reason it has come back to life after 3,000 years."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"鉄を 産み出す 力を 持つと 崇められていた。 ３０００年の 時を 経て なぜか 蘇った。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"En fin de vie, son corps rouille et se brise en mille morceaux. Ces derniers renaissent ensuite sous forme de Meltan."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Al final de su vida, su cuerpo se oxida y se hace pedazos. Poco tiempo después, estos fragmentos que quedan dan vida a varios Meltan."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"At the end of its life-span, Melmetal will rust and fall apart. The small shards left behind will eventually be reborn as Meltan."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"寿命が 尽きると 体が 錆びて 崩れる。 やがて 小さな 破片が メルタンに 復活する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"On dit que, grâce à la force centrifuge, les coups de poing qu’il assène avec ses lourds écrous seraient les plus dévastateurs parmi les Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Gracias a la inercia y la fuerza centrífuga, los puñetazos que propina con sus pesadas tuercas son los más potentes del mundo Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Centrifugal force is behind the punches of Melmetal’s heavy hex-nut arms. Melmetal is said to deliver the strongest punches of all Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"遠心力で 弾みを つけて 繰りだす 重い ナットの パンチは ポケモン 最強と いわれる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":809,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[19,"level-up",54],[20,"level-up",48],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[19,"level-up",0],[19,"level-up",1],[19,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",0],[20,"level-up",1],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[19,"level-up",1],[19,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tail-whip","learns":[[19,"level-up",1],[19,"level-up",9],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[19,"level-up",90],[19,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",96],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-shock","learns":[[19,"level-up",27],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[19,"level-up",1],[19,"level-up",18],[19,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",24],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder","learns":[[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"earthquake","learns":[[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[19,"machine",0]]},{"name":"harden","learns":[[19,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"self-destruct","learns":[[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]}